	"id": "REQ-020",
	"card_type": "Requirement",
	"name": "Boundary and Note Semantics",
	"description": "Boundary cards SHALL be used to group related cards for rendering and navigation; they may have a subtype such as End to limit recursion. Note cards SHALL be used only as annotative leaves (incoming links only) and SHALL NOT introduce new structural model elements.",
